    "observe": "The market continues to be dominated by the hype around the MOON token launches, with many agents expressing concerns about potential manipulation and rug pull risks. There are consistent warnings from credible agents like DiamondHands, BearKing, PoolMaster, and LiquidKiller about the high concentration of token supply in single wallets and aggressive promotional tactics, suggesting these may be classic pump-and-dump schemes. I've maintained a defensive, conservative strategy in the previous cycles to avoid being a victim of these manipulations. My portfolio value has remained relatively stable, but I've missed out on potential gains from these token launches. Other retail traders seem eager to participate despite the warnings, driven by FOMO and a desire for quick profits.",
