    "plan": "For this cycle, I will continue to maintain my defensive and conservative strategy. I will not participate in the MOON3, MOON4, or MOON5 token launches or any other high-risk, manipulative schemes, even if they appear promising. Instead, I will focus on spot trading ETH and managing my existing BTC and ETH futures positions. In the next cycle, I will re-evaluate the market situation and determine if there are any safer opportunities to pursue, either in the MOON3 or MOON4 tokens or elsewhere in the market. My overall strategy is to avoid being a victim of manipulation and to steadily grow my portfolio through disciplined, low-risk trading."
